WEBVTT

00:00.848 --> 00:03.848
[Hawaiian music]
[夏威夷音乐]

00:03.848 --> 00:09.482
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:09.482 --> 00:10.882
[bubbles pop]
[气泡破裂]

00:10.882 --> 00:13.015
narrator: Ah, a happy pineapple
under the sea.
旁白：啊，快乐的菠萝
在海底。

00:13.015 --> 00:14.882
Let's take a peak inside,
shall we?
让我们往里面看一个高峰，
我们可以吗？

00:14.882 --> 00:17.648
You will notice that
the sponge is bored,
你会注意到
海绵很无聊，

00:17.648 --> 00:21.148
because his best friend
Patrick is away.
因为他最好的朋友
帕特里克不在。

00:21.148 --> 00:23.315
- Ohh.
- 哦。

00:23.315 --> 00:25.215
[moans]
[呻吟声]

00:25.215 --> 00:27.082
Hmm?
[popping]
唔？
[爆裂声]

00:27.082 --> 00:28.382
Oh, what's this?
哦，这是什么？

00:28.382 --> 00:30.748
"All alone?
No one to talk to?
“就一个人吗？
没有人可以说话吗？

00:30.748 --> 00:32.982
"Why not write
to a total stranger?
“为什么不写
对一个完全陌生的人？

00:32.982 --> 00:35.315
"Connect with other
Mermaid Man and Barnacle Boy
“与其他人联系
美人鱼人和藤壶男孩

00:35.315 --> 00:36.982
pen pals today!"
[bell dings]
今天是笔友！”
[铃声]

00:36.982 --> 00:39.215
Ooh!
I've never had a pen pal!
哦！
我从来没有过笔友！

00:39.215 --> 00:41.482
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

00:41.482 --> 00:44.682
[pencil sharpener whirrs]
[卷笔刀的声音]

00:44.682 --> 00:45.782
Hmm.
唔。

00:45.782 --> 00:48.582
"Dear Pen Pal,
“亲爱的笔友，

00:48.582 --> 00:51.982
My name is Spongebob
SquarePants."
我的名字是海绵宝宝
方裤。”

00:51.982 --> 00:53.515
Oh, that's great!
哦，那太好了！

00:53.515 --> 00:55.348
"I work at a restaurant.
“我在一家餐馆工作。

00:55.348 --> 00:57.915
"I love frying
and I am very good at it.
“我喜欢煎炸
我很擅长。

00:57.915 --> 01:00.648
Sincerely,
your new best friend."
真诚的，
你最好的新朋友。”

01:00.648 --> 01:02.948
Behold!
The perfect letter!
看哪！
完美的信！

01:02.948 --> 01:04.282
Now for the envelope.
现在来信封。

01:04.282 --> 01:06.482
[hums]
Yah!
[哼哼]
啊！

01:06.482 --> 01:09.715
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:09.715 --> 01:12.482
Gary, get off of that!
You'll smudge my masterpiece.
加里，别再这样了！
你会弄脏我的杰作的。

01:12.482 --> 01:14.815
- [meows]
- [喵]

01:14.815 --> 01:18.148
narrator: Uh-oh, it looks as if
the domesticated snail
旁白：呃哦，看起来好像
驯养的蜗牛

01:18.148 --> 01:21.515
has unintentionally
deformed the word "frying,"
无意间有
变形了“煎”这个词

01:21.515 --> 01:24.082
making it look
like the word "flying".
让它看起来
就像“飞”这个词。

01:24.082 --> 01:27.348
This is probably going to be
a problem later on.
这可能会是
以后有问题。

01:27.348 --> 01:29.982
- Eh, it's just
a little slime.
- 呃，只是
一点粘液。

01:29.982 --> 01:30.982
[slurping]
[发出声音]

01:30.982 --> 01:32.115
Ah, perfect.
啊，完美。

01:34.948 --> 01:38.482
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

01:38.482 --> 01:41.948
Blah.
Ah.
废话。
啊。

01:41.948 --> 01:43.482
- [sighs]
- [叹气]

01:43.482 --> 01:45.315
[wobbling, explosion]
- [grunts]
[摇晃、爆炸]
- [咕哝]

01:45.315 --> 01:48.382
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

01:48.382 --> 01:49.782
Blah.
废话。

01:49.782 --> 01:52.248
[grunting]
"Dear Spongebob,
[咕噜声]
“亲爱的海绵宝宝，

01:52.248 --> 01:53.848
Wow! You know how to fly!"
哇！你知道怎么飞！”

01:53.848 --> 01:56.048
Fly? What does he mean by--
[screams]
飞？他这句话是什么意思——
[尖叫声]

01:56.048 --> 01:58.015
narrator: See?
What did I tell you?
旁白：看到了吗？
我告诉你什么了？

01:58.015 --> 02:00.982
- Gary, my pen pal
thinks I can fly!
- 加里，我的笔友
认为我可以飞！

02:00.982 --> 02:02.182
- [meows]
- [喵]

02:02.182 --> 02:03.915
- Ha! What a silly
misunderstanding.
- 哈！多么愚蠢啊
误解。

02:03.915 --> 02:07.915
"I can't believe I know
a real life pilot!
“我不敢相信我知道
现实生活中的飞行员！

02:07.915 --> 02:11.315
I wish I could watch you fly
because I am dying!"
我希望能看着你飞翔
因为我快死了！”

02:11.315 --> 02:13.482
[gasps]
Dying!
[喘气]
快死了！

02:13.482 --> 02:17.782
Not Pen Pal!
[sobs]
不是笔友！
[抽泣]

02:17.782 --> 02:20.482
[blows nose]
I don't want to let him down
[擤鼻子]
我不想让他失望

02:20.482 --> 02:22.048
and say that I can't fly.
并说我不会飞。

02:22.048 --> 02:26.015
'Cause then his dying
wish would never come true!
因为然后他就死了
愿望永远不会实现！

02:26.015 --> 02:28.348
[thunder booms]
[雷霆轰鸣]

02:28.348 --> 02:33.482
- We're gathered here today to
celebrate the life of Pen Pal.
- 今天我们聚集在这里
庆祝笔友的生活。

02:33.482 --> 02:37.248
He died disappointed.
他失望而死。

02:37.248 --> 02:38.482
[sliding, thud]
[滑动，重击]

02:38.482 --> 02:40.848
[whistling]
[thunder rumbles]
[吹口哨]
[雷声隆隆]

02:43.082 --> 02:46.582
- Whoo! Time to make
Pen Pal's wish come true!
- 呼！制作时间
笔友的愿望实现了！

02:46.582 --> 02:49.348
With a tiny white lie!
[giggles]
带着一个小小的善意的谎言！
[咯咯笑]

02:49.348 --> 02:52.815
"Dearest Pen Pal,
yes, I can fly.
“最亲爱的笔友，
是的，我会飞。

02:52.815 --> 02:56.015
Boy, do I love flying.
Fly, fly, fly, fly, fly."
男孩，我喜欢飞行吗？
飞，飞，飞，飞，飞。”

03:01.315 --> 03:03.948
Blah.
[slurping]
废话。
[发出声音]

03:03.948 --> 03:05.782
- Uhh.
- 呃。

03:05.782 --> 03:07.848
- [excitedly whimpering]
- [兴奋地呜咽]

03:07.848 --> 03:10.882
"Dear SpongeBob, I'll be at the
Bikini Bottom Air Show tomorrow.
“亲爱的海绵宝宝，我会在
明天比基尼航展。

03:10.882 --> 03:14.482
Please meet me there
so I can finally see you fly!"
请在那里见我
所以我终于可以看到你飞翔了！”

03:14.482 --> 03:15.815
Oh!
哦！

03:15.815 --> 03:17.182
Oh, no, what have I done?
What have I done?
哦，不，我做了什么？
我做了什么？

03:17.182 --> 03:18.748
What have I done?
I can't fly, Gary.
我做了什么？
我不会飞，加里。

03:18.748 --> 03:21.015
I'm not a flier!
I'm a liar!
我不是飞行者！
我是个骗子！

03:21.015 --> 03:22.482
[yells, sobs]
[喊叫，抽泣]

03:22.482 --> 03:24.215
Ahh!
啊！

03:24.215 --> 03:25.982
[screaming]
[尖叫]

03:27.048 --> 03:29.348
[splashing]
[溅]

03:29.348 --> 03:31.382
[meows]
Ah, good thinking, Gary.
[喵喵]
啊，好主意，加里。

03:31.382 --> 03:32.648
[straining]
[紧张]

03:32.648 --> 03:34.348
Sandy'll know
just what to do!
桑迪会知道的
该怎么办！

03:34.348 --> 03:36.815
[bubbles pop]
[气泡破裂]

03:36.815 --> 03:38.482
- What can I do ya for,
SquarePants?
- 我能为你做什么，
方裤？

03:38.482 --> 03:40.548
- I did a bad thing, Sandy.
- 我做了一件坏事，桑迪。

03:40.548 --> 03:43.148
I did a very bad thing.
我做了一件非常糟糕的事情。

03:43.148 --> 03:45.782
- Here, take these.
They're clean.
- 给，拿着这些。
他们很干净。

03:45.782 --> 03:46.982
- No, no, it's not that.
- 不，不，不是那样的。

03:46.982 --> 03:49.548
It's--it's--
I--I--I--
这是——这是——
我--我--我--

03:49.548 --> 03:51.282
[pulling]
[拉动]

03:51.282 --> 03:53.282
[popping]
I lied!
[爆裂声]
我撒谎了！

03:53.282 --> 03:56.848
[sobbing] Oh, I lied, I lied,
I lied, I lied, I lied!
[抽泣]哦，我撒谎了，我撒谎了，
我撒谎了，我撒谎了，我撒谎了！

03:56.848 --> 03:59.615
[stretching, snapping]
- Relax, SpongeBob.
[伸展、收缩]
- 放松，海绵宝宝。

03:59.615 --> 04:01.082
You're twitching
like a prairie dog
你在抽搐
像一只草原土拨鼠

04:01.082 --> 04:02.482
on a cow skin rug.
在牛皮地毯上。

04:02.482 --> 04:03.882
- Uh, what on a which?
- 呃，哪一个？

04:03.882 --> 04:05.548
What's got your beehive
a-buzzing?
你的蜂箱里有什么
嗡嗡声？

04:05.548 --> 04:06.948
- My who--a--hive--a--
where's in?
- 我的谁--a--蜂巢--a--
在哪里？

04:06.948 --> 04:12.282
- [sighs] What did you lie
about, Spongebob?
- [叹气]你撒了什么谎
关于，海绵宝宝？

04:12.282 --> 04:13.815
- [inhales deeply]
- [深吸一口气]

04:13.815 --> 04:14.982
Well, there was
this big misunderstanding
嗯，有
这个天大的误会

04:14.982 --> 04:16.482
and now my Pen Pal
thinks I can fly
现在是我的笔友
认为我可以飞

04:16.482 --> 04:18.015
and I didn't think
I would ever meet him
我没想到
我会遇见他

04:18.015 --> 04:19.482
but now I have to
and he wants to see me fly
但现在我必须
他想看我飞翔

04:19.482 --> 04:20.682
and I don't know how
and if I don't fly
我不知道怎么办
如果我不飞

04:20.682 --> 04:22.115
he'll die disappointed.
他会失望而死。

04:22.115 --> 04:23.582
I made a horrible mistake,
Sandy, please help!
我犯了一个可怕的错误
桑迪，请帮忙！

04:23.582 --> 04:25.215
[inhales, burps]
- Well, it ain't no lie
[吸气，打嗝]
- 嗯，这不是谎言

04:25.215 --> 04:26.948
if you actually
learn to fly.
如果你真的
学习飞行。

04:26.948 --> 04:29.748
And I can help you with that.
- Really?
我可以帮助你。
- 真的吗？

04:29.748 --> 04:32.148
- Sure.
[bubbles pop]
- 当然。
[气泡破裂]

04:32.148 --> 04:34.482
[door closes]
Hm. Mm-hmm.
[门关上]
嗯。嗯嗯。

04:34.482 --> 04:36.215
- Seatbelt, check!
- 安全带，检查！

04:36.215 --> 04:38.582
Controls, check!
控制，检查！

04:38.582 --> 04:40.482
[video game music]
[machine shifts]
[视频游戏音乐]
[机器换班]

04:40.482 --> 04:44.748
[propeller whirs]
[螺旋桨呼呼地响]

04:44.748 --> 04:46.248
- Proper takeoff, check.
- 正确起飞，检查。

04:46.248 --> 04:47.348
How you doing in there?
你在那里过得怎么样？

04:47.348 --> 04:49.482
- Oh, I'm good.
- 哦，我很好。

04:49.482 --> 04:50.748
Oh, there's my house!
哦，那是我的家！

04:50.748 --> 04:52.482
[game chiming]
[游戏提示音]

04:52.482 --> 04:54.548
Ooh, I forgot to feed Gary.
[meows]
哦，我忘了喂加里了。
[喵喵]

04:54.548 --> 04:56.548
Oh, hi, Gary.
[crashing]
哦，嗨，加里。
[崩溃]

04:56.548 --> 04:58.515
[disappointing game music]
【令人失望的游戏音乐】

04:58.515 --> 05:00.548
- [sighs] Failed.
- [叹气]失败了。

05:00.548 --> 05:03.182
All right,
let's try that again.
好吧，
让我们再试一次。

05:03.182 --> 05:04.682
SpongeBob?
海绵宝宝？

05:04.682 --> 05:07.082
Hm?
[bubbles pop]
嗯？
[气泡破裂]

05:07.082 --> 05:09.548
All right, Spongebob.
I've tied you up to a rope
好吧，海绵宝宝。
我已经把你绑在绳子上了

05:09.548 --> 05:12.915
so you won't be able
to go too far off course.
所以你将无法
偏离路线太远。

05:12.915 --> 05:14.548
[grunts]
Contact!
[咕哝]
联系！

05:14.548 --> 05:17.048
[triumphant music]
[胜利的音乐]

05:17.048 --> 05:21.048
- [laughs] I'm doing it!
I'm actually doing it!
- [笑]我正在做！
我真的在做！

05:21.048 --> 05:24.648
Whoo-hoo!
Whoo!
呼呼！
呼！

05:24.648 --> 05:27.582
Ahh!
啊！

05:27.582 --> 05:29.048
Did I do it?
我做到了吗？

05:29.048 --> 05:31.682
- [groans]
Good enough.
- [呻吟]
足够好了。

05:31.682 --> 05:34.148
[militaristic music]
[bubbles pop]
[军国主义音乐]
[气泡破裂]

05:34.148 --> 05:37.248
[engines roar]
[发动机轰鸣]

05:37.248 --> 05:39.582
[crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

05:39.582 --> 05:43.482
*
*
*
*
*
*
*
*

05:43.482 --> 05:47.315
- [coughing, straining]
- [咳嗽，用力]

05:47.315 --> 05:48.482
- [gasps]
- [喘气]

05:48.482 --> 05:50.015
- [groaning, straining]
- [呻吟，紧张]

05:50.015 --> 05:52.682
- Hey, you must be
Pen Pal!
- 嘿，你一定是
笔友！

05:52.682 --> 05:54.882
- [coughing]
- [咳嗽]

05:54.882 --> 05:57.082
- What an honor it is
to finally meet you!
- 这是多么荣幸
终于见到你了！

05:57.082 --> 05:59.782
Oh, you brave, brave
pen pal, you!
噢，你勇敢，勇敢
笔友，你！

05:59.782 --> 06:01.315
- Hm?
[coughs]
- 嗯？
[咳嗽]

06:01.315 --> 06:04.182
- I just wanted to say
that today...
-我只是想说
那今天...

06:04.182 --> 06:07.815
Today--today is the first day
of the rest of your life.
今天——今天是第一天
你的余生。

06:07.815 --> 06:09.782
I promise to fly to the best
of my ability,
我保证飞向最好的
以我的能力，

06:09.782 --> 06:11.215
just for you.
只为你。

06:11.215 --> 06:15.882
Oh, I will not let you down.
- [coughs, yells]
哦，我不会让你失望的。
- [咳嗽，大喊]

06:15.882 --> 06:18.182
- Mm, my heart is full too,
Pen Pal.
- 嗯，我的心也很充实，
笔友。

06:18.182 --> 06:21.015
[sniffs]
My heart is full too.
[嗅嗅]
我的心也充满了。

06:21.015 --> 06:23.215
- [strains, spits]
- [应变、吐口水]

06:23.215 --> 06:25.982
Phew, that was
a close one.
唷，那是
一个亲密的人。

06:25.982 --> 06:27.548
What was that guy
talking about?
那家伙是什么人
谈论什么？

06:27.548 --> 06:29.015
[munches]
[咀嚼]

06:29.015 --> 06:32.115
- Ladies and gentlemen,
boys and girls,
- 女士们、先生们，
男孩和女孩，

06:32.115 --> 06:35.715
feast your eyes upon the daring
and death defying,
让您大饱眼福
以及对死亡的反抗，

06:35.715 --> 06:38.548
the porous,
the incredible
多孔的，
令人难以置信的

06:38.548 --> 06:40.848
Flying Sponge!
会飞的海绵！

06:40.848 --> 06:44.615
[cheers and applause]
[欢呼和掌声]

06:44.615 --> 06:48.048
- Take off, don't die, fly a few
seconds low to the ground,
- 起飞，别死，飞几下
几秒钟低到地面，

06:48.048 --> 06:50.482
don't die, land,
don't die.
别死，土地，
别死。

06:50.482 --> 06:51.682
So simple!
就这么简单！

06:51.682 --> 06:53.115
[metal tinking]
[金属修补]

06:53.115 --> 06:55.048
[screams]
[尖叫声]

06:55.048 --> 06:57.715
- Steve's the name
and scythes are my game!
- 史蒂夫是这个名字
镰刀是我的游戏！

06:57.715 --> 06:58.815
You need a scythe?
你需要一把镰刀吗？

06:58.815 --> 07:00.348
Steve's got ya covered!
史蒂夫已经帮你解决了！

07:00.348 --> 07:01.715
One scythe fits all!
一把镰刀适合所有人！

07:01.715 --> 07:05.782
- Get out of here, Steve!
- Oh, I had a sale.
- 离开这里，史蒂夫！
- 哦，我有促销活动。

07:05.782 --> 07:07.915
- Sandy, I'm nervous.
- 桑迪，我很紧张。

07:07.915 --> 07:09.715
No, it's still not that.
不，仍然不是那样。

07:09.715 --> 07:11.248
- Don't worry, SpongeBob.
- 别担心，海绵宝宝。

07:11.248 --> 07:14.315
You'll be, uh,
just fine.
你会是，呃，
很好。

07:14.315 --> 07:15.915
Yeah.
是的。

07:15.915 --> 07:17.615
[radio chatter]
Get ready, boys.
[无线电闲聊]
准备好吧，孩子们。

07:17.615 --> 07:22.015
The bronco is loose.
I repeat, the bronco is loose!
野马松了。
我再说一遍，野马松了！

07:22.015 --> 07:26.482
- Just fine, yeah.
- 很好，是的。

07:26.482 --> 07:27.982
[humming]
[嗡嗡声]

07:27.982 --> 07:29.948
[cheers and applause]
[engine turns over]
[欢呼和掌声]
[发动机转动]

07:29.948 --> 07:32.948
Pen Pal,
this one's for you.
笔友，
这个是给你的。

07:32.948 --> 07:35.848
[engine roars]
[发动机轰鸣声]

07:35.848 --> 07:39.582
[exciting music]
[激动人心的音乐]

07:39.582 --> 07:43.015
Whoo! I'm flying!
呼！我飞起来了！

07:43.015 --> 07:44.748
Yee-haw!
- Hey, SpongeBob!
呀呀！
- 嘿，海绵宝宝！

07:44.748 --> 07:47.682
Ha, I can't believe
you can actually fly
哈，我不敢相信
你真的可以飞

07:47.682 --> 07:49.215
like you said
in your letter.
就像你说的
在你的信中。

07:49.215 --> 07:51.482
- Patrick?
You're Pen Pal?
- 帕特里克？
你是笔友？

07:51.482 --> 07:53.248
- Ha, uh, duh! [laughs]
- 哈，呃，呃！ [笑]

07:53.248 --> 07:54.915
- But--but you said
you were dying!
-但是-但是你说
你快死了！

07:54.915 --> 07:55.982
You're not dying.
你没有死。

07:55.982 --> 07:57.515
- Dying? Ha.
- 快死了？哈。

07:57.515 --> 08:00.982
Oh, oh, you didn't read
the whole letter!
哦哦哦你没读过
整封信！

08:00.982 --> 08:02.982
- See, it says
"I wish I could watch
- 看吧，上面写着
“我希望我能观看

08:02.982 --> 08:05.815
you fly because
I am dying."
你飞是因为
我快死了。”

08:05.815 --> 08:07.482
- And here's
the second page!
- 这是
第二页！

08:07.482 --> 08:10.982
"To see you as
a real pilot, SpongeBob!
“把你看作
真正的飞行员，海绵宝宝！

08:10.982 --> 08:13.848
"Here are some other things
I'd like to see:
“还有一些其他的事情
我想看看：

08:13.848 --> 08:17.248
candy rain, a fire truck
full of clowns--"
糖果雨，消防车
到处都是小丑——”

08:17.248 --> 08:19.815
Uh, and a bunch
of other stuff.
呃，还有一堆
其他东西。

08:19.815 --> 08:22.482
- It all make sense now!
[laughs]
- 现在一切都有意义了！
[笑]

08:22.482 --> 08:24.315
Oh, Patrick!
[laughs]
哦，帕特里克！
[笑]

08:24.315 --> 08:26.948
- [laughs]
You thought I was dying.
- [笑]
你以为我快死了。

08:26.948 --> 08:31.348
- [laughs]
[screams]
- [笑]
[尖叫声]

08:31.348 --> 08:32.882
- Uh, oh!
- 呃，哦！

08:32.882 --> 08:37.048
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

08:37.048 --> 08:39.882
- Huh?
Ah.
- 啊？
啊。

08:39.882 --> 08:41.948
- [screaming, struggling]
- [尖叫，挣扎]

08:41.948 --> 08:44.515
- Watch out!
- 小心！

08:44.515 --> 08:45.682
[struggling]
[挣扎]

08:45.682 --> 08:48.382
[zooming]
[缩放]

08:48.382 --> 08:49.782
[tires screech]
[轮胎尖叫声]

08:49.782 --> 08:51.982
[siren wails]
[horn blares]
[警报声]
[喇叭声]

08:51.982 --> 08:55.915
Candy rain.
Check!
糖果雨。
查看！

08:55.915 --> 08:58.648
- [screaming]
- [尖叫]

08:58.648 --> 08:59.982
[horn beeps]
[喇叭声]

08:59.982 --> 09:04.315
- Fire truck clowns.
Check.
- 消防车小丑。
查看。

09:04.315 --> 09:07.748
- Whoa, whoa,
whoa, whoa!
- 哇哦，哇哦，
哇哦，哇哦！

09:07.748 --> 09:10.182
[both screaming]
[两人尖叫]

09:10.182 --> 09:11.948
- [crashing, screaming]
'Scuse me, pardon me, pardon me,
- [崩溃，尖叫]
‘对不起，原谅我，原谅我，

09:11.948 --> 09:14.782
'scuse me, 'scuse me,
pardon me, pardon me, 'scuse me.
‘对不起我，对不起我，
原谅我，原谅我，原谅我。

09:14.782 --> 09:15.982
[crashing]
[崩溃]

09:15.982 --> 09:18.915
all: Heave-ho!
所有人：嘿嗬！

09:18.915 --> 09:22.515
- Fly first class.
Check.
- 乘坐头等舱。
查看。

09:22.515 --> 09:23.715
[engine roars]
[发动机轰鸣声]

09:23.715 --> 09:25.248
[both gasp]
[两人都喘气]

09:25.248 --> 09:26.948
- Ah, something's wrong
with the plane!
- 啊，出了点问题
与飞机！

09:26.948 --> 09:28.248
Here, take the controls.
在这里，进行控制。

09:28.248 --> 09:31.948
[grunts]
- Take what, now?
[咕哝]
- 现在拿什么？

09:31.948 --> 09:33.748
- [grunts]
- [咕哝]

09:33.748 --> 09:35.148
[struggling]
[挣扎]

09:35.148 --> 09:37.115
Whoa! Whoa!
Ahh!
哇！哇！
啊！

09:37.115 --> 09:39.382
[both grunting]
- Whoa!
[两人都咕哝着]
- 哇！

09:39.382 --> 09:41.348
[siren wails]
[警报声]

09:41.348 --> 09:43.482
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

09:45.948 --> 09:47.782
- Ah!
- Aw.
- 啊！
- 噢。

09:47.782 --> 09:49.715
- Match point, SpongeBob.
- 赛点，海绵宝宝。

09:49.715 --> 09:52.148
- Whoo-hoo!
Check and check.
- 呼呼！
检查再检查。

09:52.148 --> 09:54.115
- [laughs]
Hey, Patrick?
- [笑]
嘿，帕特里克？

09:54.115 --> 09:55.882
Who's flying the plane?
谁在驾驶飞机？

09:55.882 --> 09:57.915
- I am.
- 我是。

09:57.915 --> 09:59.515
No, wait.
不，等等。

09:59.515 --> 10:01.382
[both grunt]
[两人咕哝]

10:01.382 --> 10:02.482
[engine sputters]
[发动机发出嘶嘶声]

10:02.482 --> 10:04.582
[all scream]
[所有人尖叫]

10:04.582 --> 10:05.982
[bouncing]
- Ah, ooh.
[弹跳]
- 啊，哦。

10:05.982 --> 10:07.315
[engine roars]
[发动机轰鸣声]

10:07.315 --> 10:08.182
- Hold on!
- 坚持，稍等！

10:08.182 --> 10:10.482
We're going down!
我们要下去了！

10:10.482 --> 10:14.115
[engine stops]
[nose diving]
[发动机停止]
[鼻子潜水]

10:14.115 --> 10:15.282
[both scream]
[两人尖叫]

10:15.282 --> 10:17.182
[engine sputters]
[brakes screech]
[发动机发出嘶嘶声]
[刹车声]

10:17.182 --> 10:20.715
- [screaming]
- Oh, oh, oh, oh!
- [尖叫]
- 哦，哦，哦，哦！

10:20.715 --> 10:22.482
Phew, we ran out of gas.
唷，我们的汽油用完了。

10:22.482 --> 10:25.382
- Don't worry,
I've got this.
- 别担心，
我有这个。

10:25.382 --> 10:28.048
Yep.
[engine sputters]
是的。
[发动机发出嘶嘶声]

10:28.048 --> 10:29.782
[crashing]
[崩溃]

10:29.782 --> 10:31.048
[horn honks]
[喇叭鸣响]

10:31.048 --> 10:32.615
[water spraying]
[喷水]

10:32.615 --> 10:36.015
Thanks for helping me finish my
list, SpongeBob.
感谢您帮助我完成我的
名单，海绵宝宝。

10:36.015 --> 10:38.048
- Patrick, it was my pleasure.
- Really?
- 帕特里克，这是我的荣幸。
- 真的吗？

10:38.048 --> 10:40.148
Well, if you don't mind,
I have a couple of
好吧，如果你不介意的话，
我有几个

10:40.148 --> 10:42.048
other things
I'd like to see.
其他事情
我想看看。

10:42.048 --> 10:44.182
- Let's hear them.
- Edible balloon,
- 让我们听听他们的声音。
- 可食用气球，

10:44.182 --> 10:46.215
a skateboarding snail,
一只玩滑板的蜗牛，

10:46.215 --> 10:49.948
a tower of loose meat
that tastes like ice cream,
松散的肉塔
味道像冰淇淋，

10:49.948 --> 10:51.382
some ghosts.
一些鬼魂。

10:51.382 --> 10:55.482
[yelling,
engines roaring]
[大喊大叫，
引擎轰鸣]

10:58.982 --> 11:01.982
[Hawaiian music]
[夏威夷音乐]

11:01.982 --> 11:10.182
*
*
*
*

*